| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `plugin.toml` | Plugin identity, supported Core versions and module entries. |
{% if sources %}| `sources/<id>/` | Rust/Wasm source modules, each with its own manifest and tests. |
{% endif %}{% if integrations %}| `integrations/<id>/` | Agent integrations and their own assets or builds. |
{% endif %}| `dist/` | Generated release archive and checksum after packaging. |

